{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19187","headline":"酬令狐留守巡内至集贤院见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬令狐留守巡内至集贤院见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙院文房隔旧宫，当时盛事尽成空。\n墨池半在颓垣下，书带犹生蔓草中。\n巡内因经九重苑，裁诗又继二南风。\n爲兄手写殷勤句，遍历三台各一通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}